SUMMARY:Thursday Social
DESCRIPTION:Thursday Social at Great Bear Vineyards in Davis   Thursday\, October 1 | 5–8 PMTicket Includes: Your First Glass of WineWe’re excited to kick off our new Thursday Socials—the perfect way to ease into the weekend a little early!Gather your friends\, leave work behind\, and join us for a relaxed summer evening of award-winning wine\, great conversation\, and a little friendly competition in the beautiful setting of Great Bear Vineyards.For $15\, your ticket includes your first glass of wine\, so all you have to do is find your favorite spot among the vines and settle in for the evening.Feeling competitive? We’ve got you covered! We’ll have a selection of classic board games available\, including chess\, draughts\, Bananagrams\, and dominos. Challenge your friends to a game\, meet someone new\, or simply sit back\, sip your wine\, and enjoy the vineyard atmosphere. Cheese and light snacks will be available for purchase\, or you’re welcome to bring your own picnic and make an evening of it.Whether you’re catching up with friends\, planning a casual date night\, or looking for a new weekly tradition\, Thursday Social is all about slowing down\, sharing good company\, and enjoying summer evenings at the vineyard.Good wine. Great friends. Beautiful vineyard views. We can’t wait to welcome you to Thursday Social!
URL:https://visitdavis.org/event/thursday-social/
LOCATION:Great Bear Vineyards\, Great Bear Vineyards 24800 Co Rd 101A\, Davis\, CA 95616
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://visitdavis.org/wp-content/uploads/Great-Bear-Vineyards_23GBV-drone-scaled-zK0eUQ.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Great Bear Vineyards":MAILTO:greatbearvineyards@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
