SUMMARY:The Nickel Slots Live at The HIVE
DESCRIPTION:Live at The HIVE presents The Nickel Slots during an outdoor concert. Doors at 5:30pm; Music at 6:30pm. \nFrom sentimental folk to foot stomping\, raucous sing-along Americana\, you’ll be taken on a journey of joy\, heartache\, hope and redemption. Enjoy a seasonal menu\, craft beverages and complimentary honey tasting at The HIVE Tasting Room & Kitchen\, northern California’s largest honey and mead tasting room. \nPay what you can cover charge: $0-$20/person. \nFamily and dog friendly. All ages welcome. No outside food or drinks.
