DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261009T113000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261009T170000
DTSTAMP:20261001T173033Z
CREATED:20260929T180052Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261001T173033Z
UID:10003074-1791545400-1791565200@visitdavis.org
SUMMARY:Portraits of Things: Paintings by Gioia Fonda and Charlie Gill
DESCRIPTION:Portraits of Things: Paintings by Gioia Fonda and Charlie Gill at Pence Gallery in Davis \nExhibit: October 9 – November 29\, 2026 \nReception: Friday\, October 9\, 6-9 PM (Free) \nArtist Talk: Sunday\, November 8\, 2-3:30 PM (Free) \n  \nInterdisciplinary artist Gioia Fonda has long collected colorful toys\, both for their intrinsic charm and as creative inspiration. As a student at California College of the Arts\, she arranged small collectibles into still-life compositions\, captured them on film\, and processed the photos at a local drugstore. Captivated by these arrangements\, her advisor\, Charlie Gill\, painted spare compositions based on her photographs—works that now hang alongside hers. For this exhibition\, Fonda has created a series of new paintings featuring similar arrangements of toys and found objects. She is also offering an opportunity for members of the public to exhibit their own small works on paper\, riffing on some of her recent photos. Artists may add to this display throughout the duration of the show.  \n  \nSponsored by the Pence Community Curatorial Fund. \n  \nImage: Gioia Fonda\, “Holding It Together”
URL:https://visitdavis.org/event/portraits-of-things-paintings-by-gioia-fonda-and-charlie-gill/
LOCATION:Pence Gallery\, 212 D Street\, Davis\, CA 95616
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://visitdavis.org/wp-content/uploads/Gioia-Fonda-Holding-It-Together-copy-FzJXUg.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Pence Gallery":MAILTO:pencesocialmedia@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Visit Davis": "https://visitdavis.org/event/2nd-friday-artabout-at-the-pence-gallery-18/", "Visityolo Event": "https://visityolo.com/event/2nd-friday-artabout-at-the-pence-gallery-20/"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Visit Davis": "https://visitdavis.org/event/2nd-friday-artabout-at-the-pence-gallery-18/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:visitdavis
X-SOURCE:Visit Davis, Visityolo Event
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261009T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261009T210000
DTSTAMP:20261001T173035Z
CREATED:20260917T173037Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261001T173035Z
UID:10003065-1791568800-1791579600@visitdavis.org
SUMMARY:2nd Friday ArtAbout at the Pence Gallery
DESCRIPTION:Join us at the Pence Gallery in Davis for our 2nd Friday ArtAbout reception on October 9\, 6-9 PM. Enjoy browsing all new exhibits\, complimentary wine\, and an art-themed scavenger hunt. Free admission! \n  \nPortraits of Things: Paintings by Gioia Fonda and Charlie Gill | Oct. 9 – Nov. 29\, 2026 \nThis series features Gioia Fonda’s new paintings of arrangements of toys and found objects\, alongside paintings by her advisor Charlie Gill based on her past still-life photographs. \n  \nMercy Hawkins: Waltz of Life & Limb | Oct. 3 – Nov. 6\, 2026  \nPairing her sculptural paintings and vibrant\, large-scale watercolors on paper\, Mercy Hawkins’ biomorphic shapes speak to a sensory play of color\, light\, and movement. Her imagery evokes seed pods\, flower buds\, or microscopic creatures.  \n  \nDanilo Campos: Out and About | Oct. 9 – Nov. 29\, 2026 \nDanilo Campos’ paintings explore his love of new places and experiences\, reflecting his way of seeming to mindlessly go ‘out and about\,’ but coming back with gems of resources. \n  \nMisuk Goltz’s Class: Expressive Watercolor | Oct. 2 – Nov. 15\, 2026 \nThis stairway show illustrates what Misuk Goltz’s watercolor students have achieved during the course of her workshops and reflects the community of painting\, encouragement\, and friendship that she has fostered while teaching at the Pence since 2020.  \n  \nScavenger Hunt: Join us for a fun\, art-themed scavenger hunt at the Pence during the 2nd Friday ArtAbout. Complete all of the clues by exploring our exhibits for the chance to win a special prize. \n  \n— \n  \nVisit the Pence and other venues in Downtown Davis for the 2nd Friday ArtAbout art walk. We will have printed ArtAbout guides available that week. Follow the ArtAbout’s Facebook page for more information: https://www.facebook.com/davisartabout. \n  \nImages: \nGioia Fonda\, “Holding It Together” \nMercy Hawkins\, “Melting Ice” \nDanilo Campos\, “Sunday Market” \nFrances Burke\, “Star Gazer”
URL:https://visitdavis.org/event/2nd-friday-artabout-at-the-pence-gallery-18/
LOCATION:Pence Gallery\, 212 D Street\, Davis\, CA 95616
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://visitdavis.org/wp-content/uploads/Pence-Reception-Banners-1-2-42fpB1.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Pence Gallery":MAILTO:pencesocialmedia@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
