SUMMARY:Mosaics Water & Acrylic Painting
DESCRIPTION:Davis Art\, Music & Outdoor Activities Meetup\n**Discover Inte
 rcultural Mosaics Hub – Summer 2026!**\nJoin us for a vibrant and uplift
 ing season of virtual learning and community from **June 20 to August 29\,
  2026**—all from the comfort of your home on Zoom!\n**Zoom Link:** [http
 s://zoom.us/j/589676463](https://zoom.us/j/589676463)\n**Bi-Weekly Friday 
 Zoom Sessions** *(Every 2nd and 4th Friday)*\n• **4:00 PM** – Advanced
  Korean with Stephen\n• **5:00 PM** – Intermediate Conversational Chin
 ese with Sam\n• **6:00 PM** – Bible Study & Meditation Group with Step
 hen\n• **7:00 PM** – Beginning Chinese with Jane\n**Weekly Saturday Zo
 om Sessions** (total of 10 sessions)\n• **4:00 PM** – Beginning Spanis
 h with Viviana\n• **5:00 PM** – Beginning to Intermediate Korean with 
 Stephen\n• **6:00 PM** – Beginning to Intermediate Japanese with Norio
 \n• **7:00 PM** – English Learners Group with Linda & Chad\n___\n**Imp
 ortant Notes:**\n1. **No Zoom sessions** on **July 3–4\, 2026** (Indepen
 dence Day) and **September 4–5\, 2026** (Labor Day).\n2. All classes wil
 l be conducted **exclusively via Zoom** during the summer session.\n3. **R
 eturn to In-Person Meetings:**\nWe will resume our **regular in-person gat
 herings on September 12\, 2026** at the **2nd floor rooms of Phoenix Hall\
 , Davis Community Church**.\nFor more information about Intercultural Mosa
 ics classes and activities\, visit [www.nextg.org](http://www.nextg.org/) 
 or contact Dr. Stephen Moon at 916-217-5470\nor email to: [catalyst@nextg.
 org](mailto:catalyst@nextg.org). Thank you!
